00:25:22,890 --> 00:25:24,680
 Components are like connectors, exactly.

536
00:25:24,680 --> 00:25:26,970
 It's more of a connector, like a single service.

537
00:25:26,970 --> 00:25:29,690
 Personal assistant has-- so a personal assistant,

