00:25:34,250 --> 00:25:38,170
 It has a use case, and it has memory, has its own persona,

540
00:25:38,170 --> 00:25:39,090
 does different things.

541
00:25:39,090 --> 00:25:45,160
 But it has concrete workflows, a set of workflows.

542
00:25:45,160 --> 00:25:46,880
 So a personal assistant could be like,

543
00:25:46,880 --> 00:25:49,040
 let's say, I'm organizing these back events.

544
00:25:49,040 --> 00:25:51,250
 There's a lot of things that go into this.

