00:25:51,250 --> 00:25:52,930
 I need to first book the meeting.

546
00:25:52,930 --> 00:25:55,680
 I need to get sponsorships.

547
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:58,940
 I need to see the costs, get the insurance, and so on.

548
00:25:58,940 --> 00:26:04,560
 So a component would be just booking the room.

549
00:26:04,560 --> 00:26:08,130
 Personal assistant is doing all that thing together.

550
00:26:08,130 --> 00:26:09,700
 The use case is higher level when

551
00:26:09,700 --> 00:26:10,980
 it comes to personal assistant.

552
00:26:10,980 --> 00:26:12,100
 It's automating workflows.

553
00:26:12,100 --> 00:26:13,580
 That's what a personal assistant is.

554
00:26:13,580 --> 00:26:14,700
 Automating workflows, yeah.

