00:29:55,390 --> 00:29:57,110
 which interact with each other in order

641
00:29:57,110 --> 00:29:58,070
 to give you the results.

642
00:29:58,070 --> 00:29:59,380
 Exactly, yeah.

643
00:29:59,380 --> 00:30:01,520
 So you have a personal assistant for every domain.

